   below it (the head is a centered flex row by default; switch it to a centered column).
   Covers every action card — Speak + the --as-button cards (Extras / Account / Create a
   Board / Reports / Edit Dashboard). Gentle-scoped so Focused is untouched. */
@media (max-width: 640px) {
