   instead, and the badge's own absolute-on-the-title-row rule (see
   `.new-board--modern .modal-header .create-board-actions:has(.nb-ai-mode-wrap)
   .nb-ai-mode-badge` further down) needs `.modal-header` to be the
   nearest positioned ancestor — making the action row position:
   relative here would re-anchor the badge to the row instead, pull
   the badge out of the title-row spot, and collapse the Other Create
