  // board-alt rule above (the shorthand resets background-image to
  // none and wipes the data-URI silhouette painted by
  // `.user_holder--default`). Default-avatar users on modern board
  // pages should see the silhouette through this light-glass tint;
  // real-avatar users keep their photo via the visible `<img class="user">`.
  #inner_header:has(#speak) #identity .user_holder {
